[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ありましたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロザリオ立候補しましたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また二幕には出れませんでしたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうなったら選ばれるまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の技が認めてもらえるまでいるっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで千秋楽まで出なかったらそれはそれで伝説だぜっっっっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと最近自分を出そうとすると意地でも出さない自分がいる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつからだろうか〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか前も書いたかこんなこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はどの役に立候補しようかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/06/04/5907123/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二幕に出れない代わりにライブでは自分にとっては恥ずかしすぎる髪型をするのさ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこれ見て笑ってね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/06/04/5907123/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張るか〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！⭐︎"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7191":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなっちゃったけどみなさんただいま〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台湾にｈｔｃのキャンペーンに行って参りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台湾の皆さまありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく歓迎してくださって沢山の方が乃木坂を知ってくださっていてすごく嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頑張らなくては!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして久しぶりにメンバーに会ってほっこりした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/2129131/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの顔を見たら帰ってきたんだな〜と実感しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいお姉ちゃんと妹ちゃんに囲まれて幸せよヽ(´▽`)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん元気に過ごしてたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさいませ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/2129131/0001.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-16551":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n2期生の新内眞衣です(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、、、\n純奈がよくツインテールを\nしてるのですが、\n髪の長さ的に\nバナナを2本こしらえてる\nようにしか見えません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな純奈たん\n私の誕生日には12時ぴったり\nに写真付きでメールをくれました。\nなんていい子なんだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てなわけで、\n今日も11日に1回の\n長い長いブログが始まります(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ\n良かったら最後まで読んでね(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生生活"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、学生生活最後の\n授業をしてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は卒業課題の提出日で、\nみんなせかせかと課題の\n最終調整をしていたので\n授業らしい授業では\nありませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもでも！\n先生から最後お話があり\nとても思い出に残る\n最後の授業となりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校の頃からずっと\n社会科が得意で、\n大学もそっち方面を\n学んできました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"授業も楽しかったし、\nこの学部に進んで\n良かったと思ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"義務教育から約16年間"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校、中学校、高校、大学\nと学生生活を送ってきましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから\n『学生』じゃなくなるなんて\nまだ実感が湧かないです(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも後悔しないように\n好きな事を勉強してこれて\n幸せでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、もう1つ、、、\nこの日嬉しい事がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと、ゼミの友達が\n誕生日サプライズを\nやってくれたんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3限の授業が終わって\nいつも通り教室に行こうとしたら、\n友達が教室を間違えちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『どこだっけー？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかいいながらウロウロしてたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暗い教室に連れ込まれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ってると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッピーバースデートゥーユー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってゼミのみんなが歌いだして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくり！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あ、大学ではまいまいって\n呼ばれてます....笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段みんな適当だから\nこんな事しないのに(T_T)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当みんなありがとう(T_T)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が入っていたゼミは元々、\n全員が第1志望のゼミに\n落ちた人たちで集まった\nゼミでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど2年半ずっと一緒に\n授業してきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(先生の強制で←)\n学園祭の模擬店やったり、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生とみんなで\nサッカー観戦行ったりして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に時間を共有することで\nみんなとの仲がどんどん\n深まっていきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に私はサークルとかにも\n入ってなかったので、\nゼミがなかったらこういった\n大学生らしい経験も\n出来なかったなーって\nしみじみ思います（´-`）.｡oO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物凄く仲良くて毎月ご飯行く！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかいうゼミではなかったけど、\n適度な距離感が心地よい、\nそんなゼミでした(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかくみんなありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次会うのは謝恩会だけど、\nこれからもOG会などで\n会いましょう(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ8枚目シングルの\n選抜発表がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回私は選抜に入ることが\n出来ませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも\n気持ちは前向きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからの8枚目の期間の\nたくさんの経験の中で\nもっと自分を高められるように\nしていきたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいところは伸ばして\nダメなところは改善する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に課題を課せながら\n8枚目に向き合っていくので\nよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもお世話になってる\nまいまいさん\n初の2列目おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新選抜の\nまあやさんとひなちゃんも\nおめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2期生からは\n未央奈と日奈子！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈は7枚目の期間で\nとても成長したと思うし\n8枚目もフロントという\n立ち位置なので\nこれからも輝いて欲しいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子は初選抜おめでとう！\n牛久やトナカイを一緒に経験\nしてきたし、\n本当に頑張って欲しいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも辛くなったら\n焼肉食べながら話聞くから、\n遠慮なく言ってね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もまだまだ頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだNOGIBIGOの収録に\n参加してきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は出ないのですが、\n来週は出るので\n良かったらチェックして下さいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう\n告知出来るの嬉しいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n今日はみなみさんとの写真で\nお別れです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0021.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また11日後まで\n忘れずに待っていてくださいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/01/31/7711133/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新内眞衣"}],"source":"archive"}}